      "q": "How much does CACI Federal make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "CACI Federal has $2B in contract obligations in FY2026 to date. CACI Federal received 183 awards so far, with an average award size of $11.2M, and obligations were down 42.0% year over year compared with the prior fiscal period."
